  - How does Jo still have this job? How do you just FORGET to note down the square
    footage of the floor? Is she stupid??
  - Whatever. It'll take me two minutes to measure the floor's length and width,
    then I can go home. I'll make sure to spit in her coffee tomorrow.
  - "Good thing I always have my measuring tape on me\u2026"
  - '*To measure the floor, interact with one corner of the room to take out your
    measuring tape, then move along the wall to the other side*'
